{"nodes": [{"id": "supabase_tests_audit_trigger_test_audit_trigger_test", "label": "audit_trigger_test (card ^ref-06)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "supabase/tests/audit_trigger_test.sql", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Failure-case suite for the generic audit trigger. Coverage sweep: every public table except audit_log carries trg_audit_<table>, and audit_log itself does not (that would recurse). TC-19/TC-20 on lot_receipts: INSERT records actor_id, actor_role, event_date, a null `before`, the weight inside `after`, and the mismatch reason mapped from variance_reason onto the single audit reason column; audit created_at is now() even though the row's own created_at was supplied 26 years stale, and the supplied value survives inside the snapshot; idempotency_key is null on a table that has none. UPDATE keeps both old and new values; DELETE keeps `before` and a null `after`. TC-18: audit_log refuses UPDATE, DELETE and TRUNCATE. Explicitly a failure-mode suite."}], "edges": [{"source": "supabase_tests_audit_trigger_test_audit_trigger_test", "target": "supabase_functions_fn_audit_row_fn_audit_row", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "supabase/tests/audit_trigger_test.sql", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "supabase_tests_audit_trigger_test_audit_trigger_test", "target": "supabase_functions_fn_audit_row_fn_audit_log_append_only", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "supabase/tests/audit_trigger_test.sql", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "supabase_tests_audit_trigger_test_audit_trigger_test", "target": "supabase_migrations_20260908000002_identity_config_audit_log", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "supabase/tests/audit_trigger_test.sql", "source_location": null, "weigh